---
description: Backend conventions for NestJS/FastAPI/MongoDB
globs: ["src/api/**", "src/services/**", "src/modules/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Validate input with Zod (TS) or Pydantic (Python).
- Typed errors, not generic messages.
- Do not leak stack traces to the client.
- Soft deletes by default.
- Pagination on collections.
- Rate limiting on public routes.
